[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3572724380","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113127#issuecomment-3572724380","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113127","id":3572724380,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U83Kc","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T21:06:42Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T21:06:42Z","body":"Color have 4 components, `Color(0, 0, 0)` is actually `Color(0, 0, 0, 1)`, since alpha defaults to `1`, so the result of this sum is `Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 2.0)`. Not sure if this is an issue, and if there's any meaning to alpha values over `1.0` (for color components, values above `1.0` are valid for overbright/HDR).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3572724380/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3572759928","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113127#issuecomment-3572759928","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113127","id":3572759928,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U8_14","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T21:15:42Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T21:16:18Z","body":"toafloast on discord tested varying alpha, and you're right, it does lead to that issue:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba02f9dd-551d-49b9-8aa9-155a0e390c6f\n\nAnd their code:\n\n<img width=\"511\" height=\"266\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09107ec8-146b-4828-9364-9ff2a15d676f\" />\n\nThis behaviour still feels unexpected, but I don't know how you'd deal with this nicely, so I'm not sure whether to close this or not.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3572759928/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3574006393","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113127#issuecomment-3574006393","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113127","id":3574006393,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VBwJ5","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T06:47:22Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T06:47:22Z","body":"> This behaviour still feels unexpected, but I don't know how you'd deal with this nicely, so I'm not sure whether to close this or not.\n\nIn my opinion, using the `+` operator with colors without reading the documentation is always a recipe for unexpected results, since it's unclear how exactly this operation is defined. Color operations have dedicated methods: `blend()`, `darkened()`, `lightened()`, and so on.\n\nWe could add a clarification to the `+` operator's description or a note to the `Color` class's description. But sometimes the root cause of confusion isn't unclear wording in the documentation, but rather that users don't read it, instead assuming what they think is intuitive behavior. I don't know if this is the case here, but I suspect users are less likely to check the documentation for operators than for methods.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3574006393/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3576808319","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113127#issuecomment-3576808319","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113127","id":3576808319,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VMcN_","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T17:44:50Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T17:44:50Z","body":"I was initially going to add a Vector3 to the Color but that wasn't listed in the docs and so I ended up adding a Color.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3576808319/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocke